Release play at the end of a refresh-rate switch (AE#950)

AetherEngine 7.62.1 removed the 1000 ms hold after modeSwitchEnd:
https://github.com/superuser404notfound/AetherEngine/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md
The vendored 7.70 copy still applies it, so remove it here. The AE#1037
startup guard this patch once carried is part of the vendored engine.

